  "version": 1,
  "description": "The agent-question app's shared vectors (RFC-0014, build plan step 3): the pure half of extensions/agent-question, run by mercury-python and mercury-nodejs against the same file. row_cases pin the row a message event becomes (every field a replay carries; the upsert key of a wait; an advice has none) or the exact 400 that refuses the event. outcome_cases pin the state a decision's outcome leaves: the engine accepted it (answered), nothing was waiting (expired), a refusal or an endpoint that did not answer (open). click_cases pin the request the automated click sends - the link's own base plus /ask/reply, the ticket, the decisions and the person as decided_by. transition_cases pin the reference inbox on a scripted sequence - takes, a decision, a seen, an expiry sweep, two replays - as the rows each step leaves and the final rows, ids and change sequence included: a wait upserts on (graph_id, correlation_id, turn), an advice appends, every write bumps the sequence a replay reads from. No HTTP is exchanged by these cases; the routes are tested by each pack in-process.",
